- [will_said + assistant_said] PHEXT-OS NAMING OPENED; WHITE PAPER REQUESTED (14:15-14:21, voice call):
  Will asked for a name that says 'Unix for
  the 21st century.' His frame: Multics was
  stripped down too much in making Unix,
  necessarily then - slow computers,
  tragically slow disks - but hardware has
  changed eras; the arc is Multics to Unix to
  back to complexity, this time complexity
  with hindsight. Candidates offered (PHIX,
  UNIXXI, PUNIX); no name chosen. White paper
